<title>USA: Kennametal to buy back up to 1.6 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Kennametal to buy back up to 1.6 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LATROBE, Pa. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kennametal Inc said Friday it plans to buy back up to 1.6 million shares of its outstanding capital stock for investment or other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The repurchases are to take place from time to time. They may be made in the open market, or in negotiated or other permissable transactions, it said.</p>
<p>Kennametal currently has about 26.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
